window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>“If you’re a good girl tonight, maybe I’ll treat you like a bad one later.”</i></b></p> <p>As a human living in the isolated supernatural town of Midnight Harbor, there’s only two choices for me: leave Midnight or pledge my allegiance to one of the supernatural Houses.</p> <p>It’s expected I’ll follow my family lineage and pledge myself to the Locke Vampire House. But with my pledging day approaching, I’m determined to live my own life and leave Midnight.</p> <p>I would have made good on that promise if it wasn’t for my vampire neighbor, Bran Duval, black sheep of the powerful Duval House.</p> <p>Bran reveals that my sister has secretly asked Duval House to bid on me breaking all of Midnight’s tradition. Bran doesn’t know the reason but I think he’s just as curious as I am because we’re soon teaming up to uncover the secrets.</p> <p>But the longer I’m with Bran, the less control I seem to have over my own desires. Especially when Bran is commanding me in the dark, igniting something in me I didn’t even know I had.</p> <p>And when Bran finally sinks his fangs into me, everything about my life comes into question.</p> <p>Because my blood? <i>It isn’t human.<br> <br> NOTE: Secrets Drenched in Blood is the full, complete Midnight Harbor Series (Hot Vampire Next Door books one through five). Please check the author's website for content warnings.</i></p>"; 
